  {
    "title": "Failures, with conditions",
    "body": "State each failure with its condition and what players see. **If the store's main copy fails**, the replica takes over within seconds, and outbox rows not yet confirmed are copied again; \"only if higher\" makes repeats harmless. **If both copies are lost**, the set is rebuilt from `best_scores`, 50 million rows, in minutes; meanwhile the last saved top 100 stays visible and \"my rank\" shows \"updating\". **If the relay stops**, new bests wait in the outbox and N2 is missed until it restarts.",
